ks  from slavery and this was a new  beginning and so  you know that none of that can be taken  away that happened and it affected  so many people misty copeland thank you  very much for joining us  you can listen to the full interview on  our podcast the economist asks  every week we publish a conversation  we've had with a high profile figure  click the link opposite to enjoy it and  thanks for watching

